  "reason": "The best accuracy so far is config_009 (scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, weighted) at 0.725. All top performers use scvi_n200 + multiprofile + transformer aggregation. The one untested resnet50 variant (config_024: transformer+weighted) achieved the highest F1 (0.6945) of all experiments, suggesting resnet50+transformer has strong discriminative capacity. Config_028 (scvi_n200, resnet50, transformer, concat) tests whether concat fusion—competitive with weighted in the imagenet_vit_l setting (0.721 vs 0.725)—might complement resnet50's features differently. As the final experiment, this is the highest-expected-value remaining option among scvi_n200 multiprofile configurations, as it explores the only untested fusion×image-encoder pairing within the proven top-performing architecture family."
}

